Z||000024||The Fieromaster||11-07-2001||10:54 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by GTMike:<BR><B>what ever.  all i said is that i could put 40 yards on my moms gs.  same driver and everything.   its a neat car. but its not early as quick is MY fiero.     whats the gs rated in the 1/4 and 0-60.  where are you located. i'm driving MY fiero across the country  at the end of december.  i'll be going on I-80 from colorado to NY.  and i'll race you.  if your located neat I-80 </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Actually If your goin to NY I am right off I-80 in Ohio!  I would take I-80 to I-90 if your goin to NY though. Its faster! Also i-90 isnt a toll road! Faster cause I-80 takes you down the bottom/middle of the<BR>state and I-90 stays at the top where PA and NY is!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  I will race ya though... Although by then the GS will have the turbo on her so i think it may be unfair.<P>(p.s.) Anger management working now... feel better  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">         <FONT COLOR="red">"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">      <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif"">                 <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AIM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="green">1992 Mitsubishi Eclipse GS ~ soon will be turboed</FONT><BR></B>||||reg||1
Z||000025||GTMike||11-07-2001||04:47 PM||||well thats the way i go. take 90 to 17 all the way to binghamton. <P>if you have a turbo it would be neat to see. <P>oh by the way. i got some numbers from road and track   road test summary. the 98 gs-t is only rated at 15.2 in the 1/4   i wasn't able to find what the older gs could do. i'm assuming it would do mid to low 16s so it could be a closer race than i though.  <P>    that would be a good sleep car to build up. especially if you have the flat hood with out the bump.  ||||reg||1
Z||000026||The Fieromaster||11-08-2001||02:40 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by GTMike:<BR><B>well thats the way i go. take 90 to 17 all the way to binghamton. <P>if you have a turbo it would be neat to see. <P>oh by the way. i got some numbers from road and track   road test summary. the 98 gs-t is only rated at 15.2 in the 1/4   i wasn't able to find what the older gs could do. i'm assuming it would do mid to low 16s so it could be a closer race than i though.  <P>    that would be a good sleep car to build up. especially if you have the flat hood with out the bump.  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well i cant do anything to the hood... cause the bump is there for a purpose... The engine is rather tall and the bump is there to clear the timing gears!  No bump = slam hood into gears..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  I had a GSX (all wheel drive) that ran 14.3 with just squeezing off the hose for the wastegate (uped boose to 18 from 15)... Although you also gotta remember my GS to turbo will be faster than a GST cause i already have 9.5:1 compression rather than 7.3:1!!  SO with me runnin 7lbs (less due to havin more comp.) I should be in the 250 hp range!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif"> welcome to my world... lol.  Whats in your Fiero?<BR><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">         <FONT COLOR="red">"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">      <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif"">                 <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AIM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="green">1992 Mitsubishi Eclipse GS ~ soon will be turboed</FONT><BR></B>||||reg||1
